Selector(&#39;ul&#39;)) {&#xA;        e.classList.toggle(&#39;unfolded&#39;);&#xA;    }&#xA;});&#xA;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&#34;content column is-9&#34;&gt; &#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;events&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Events&#xA;    &lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#events&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;    ¶&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Stay informed about our upcoming meetups, workshops, and conferences. Join us to advance your geospatial skills, share knowledge, and network with fellow QGIS professionals and enthusiasts across Cameroon and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
