    <item>
      <title>Internal Regulations</title>
      <link>//localhost:1313/internal-regulations/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>//localhost:1313/internal-regulations/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;is-hidden-touch edit-on-github&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;a&#xA;        class=&#34;button is-light is-small is-rounded&#34;&#xA;        href=&#34;https://github.com/michaekong/QGIS-CAMEROUN//edit/master/content/internal-regulations.md&#34;&#xA;        target=&#34;_blank&#34;&#xA;        rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;icon&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;i class=&#34;fab fa-github&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span&gt;Edit on GitHub&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;section class=&#34;section  pt-3&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;container content&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &#xA;        &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;internal-regulations-of-the-qgis-cameroon-association&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Internal Regulations of the QGIS Cameroon Association&#xA;    &lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#internal-regulations-of-the-qgis-cameroon-association&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;    ¶&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supplementary document to the Association&amp;rsquo;s Statutes, detailing the practical organization of bodies, member categories, thematic poles, regional branches, and the progressive designation of leadership roles.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;em&gt;Draft submitted to the Constitutive General Assembly – Yaoundé, Republic of Cameroon – 2026&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;title-i--general-provisions&#34;&gt;&#xA;    Title I — General Provisions&#xA;    &lt;a class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; href=&#34;#title-i--general-provisions&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;    ¶&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Article 1 — Object of the Internal Regulations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;These Internal Regulations supplement the Statutes of the QGIS Cameroon Association (hereinafter &amp;ldquo;the Association&amp;rdquo;), established pursuant to Law No. 90/053 of December 19, 1990, on the freedom of association, as amended by Law No. 99/014 of December 22, 1999. They specify the practical modalities for the operation of the Association&amp;rsquo;s bodies, member categories, organization into thematic poles and regional branches, as well as the mechanism for the progressive designation of leadership roles.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
