n, as amended by Law No. 99/014 of December 22, 1999. They specify the practical modalities for the operation of the Association&amp;rsquo;s bodies, member categories, organization into thematic poles and regional branches, as well as the mechanism for the progressive designation of leadership roles.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
